cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin, please cite it as below, together with the sibling plugin whose measure you report."
type: software
title: "Object Colocalization Suite"
abstract: >-
  Fiji/ImageJ plugin that runs thirteen colocalization methods (object
  overlap, centroid coincidence and distance, per-object and whole-image
  intensity correlation, cross-type spatial statistics and Voronoi territory
  occupancy) over the same 2 to 5 label images, reports every method per
  object in one table, tests each against a shuffled-object chance model,
  compares the methods with each other, and classifies which are informative
  on the data at hand. Runs from a dialog, from macros, headless, from Java
  and as folder batches.
authors:
